  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Creation sphere.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Treat your character level as your caster level for when determining which objects you may alter, such as through your (material) talents, as well as your damage dealt/healed with Repair or Destroy. This has no effect on any use of create.</p>\n<p><strong>Special:</strong> You cannot have both Creation Mastery and Master Of Remaking.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/creation#toc77\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
